OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1787059118
OL,3,CSunderland mother creates app to help
OL,4,Cparents secure SEND diagnoses and
OL,5,Csupport
OL,7,FWatch Kris Jepson's report on the
OL,8,Fmother who set up an app to help other
OL,9,Fparents secure SEND support.
OL,11,FA mother of two neurodivergent
OL,12,Fchildren in Sunderland has created an
OL,13,Fapp to help support other families as
OL,14,Fthey try to secure diagnoses and
OL,15,Fsupport for children with special
OL,16,Feducational needs and disabilities or
OL,17,FSEND.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
