CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1787059118
OL,3,CSunderland mother creates app to help
OL,4,Cparents secure SEND diagnoses and
OL,5,Csupport
OL,7,FNicola Leonard drew on her own lived
OL,8,Fexperience of navigating the system
OL,9,Ffor years, attending "overwhelming"
OL,10,FSEND and Educational Health and Care
OL,11,FPlan meetings (EHCP), whereby parents
OL,12,Fhave to provide enough evidence to
OL,13,Fsecure the correct support for their
OL,14,Fchildren.
OL,16,FThe app is called Understanding My
OL,17,FChild and it aims to help parents
OL,18,Fgather the information professionals
OL,19,Fask for calmly and stored in one place.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,392,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1787059118
OL,3,CSunderland mother creates app to help
OL,4,Cparents secure SEND diagnoses and
OL,5,Csupport
OL,7,FNicola told ITV News Tyne Tees that
OL,8,Fincidents that can prove evidential,
OL,9,Fsuch as child meltdowns, can be
OL,10,Frecorded on the app.
OL,12,F"Afterwards, you can go back and see
OL,13,Fpatterns," she explained. "These days
OL,14,Fof the week are hard, these tools
OL,15,Fnever work, these tools always work,
OL,16,Fthese are the places that we seem to
OL,17,Fhave the biggest problems.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,392,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1787059118
OL,3,CSunderland mother creates app to help
OL,4,Cparents secure SEND diagnoses and
OL,5,Csupport
OL,7,F"While you're in it and while you're
OL,8,Fdrowning and while you're surviving on
OL,9,Fvery little sleep most likely, you
OL,10,Fcan't do that for yourself, so we
OL,11,Fwanted to make it so you can see that
OL,12,Fpattern."
OL,14,FShe said having the evidence base in
OL,15,Fone place helps to strengthen
OL,16,Fapplications for support.
OL,18,F"It's incredibly important," she said.
OL,19,F"There are hundreds and thousands of
OL,20,Fpeople waiting for a diagnosis at the
OL,21,Fmoment.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,392,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1787059118
OL,3,CSunderland mother creates app to help
OL,4,Cparents secure SEND diagnoses and
OL,5,Csupport
OL,7,F"You need to have that proof to say
OL,8,Fthis is a pattern of behaviour,
OL,9,Fbecause that's what the paediatricians
OL,10,Flook for. This is what I've already
OL,11,Ftried, because they will send you away
OL,12,Fif you haven't tried things and this
OL,13,Fis the impact of us trying that.
OL,15,F"If you have those three things, it's
OL,16,Fvery difficult to send you away and
OL,17,Fsay you need more."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
