PN,39106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1787059118
OL,3,CSunderland mother creates app to help
OL,4,Cparents secure SEND diagnoses and
OL,5,Csupport
OL,7,FThe app also offers guidance on what
OL,8,Fparents need to do in the process of
OL,9,Fsecuring an education, health and care
OL,10,Fplan for their children and has been
OL,11,Finformed by autism charities,
OL,12,Ftherapists, SEND teachers and
OL,13,Feducational psychologists.
OL,15,FHolly James' family was one of the
OL,16,Ffirst to benefit from using the app
OL,17,Fand she said it not only gathers
OL,18,Fevidence for key meetings, but also
OL,19,Fhelps parents with planning everyday
OL,20,Flife.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,392,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F391A1787059118
OL,3,CSunderland mother creates app to help
OL,4,Cparents secure SEND diagnoses and
OL,5,Csupport
OL,7,F"Having this app brings everything
OL,8,Ftogether," she said. "It makes you
OL,9,Funderstand your situation, your child
OL,10,Fbetter.
OL,12,F"It signposts you to things which work
OL,13,Ffor him, that don't work for him. I
OL,14,Fnow look in my local area that links
OL,15,Fall those things together. By creating
OL,16,Fthat understanding of your child, it
OL,17,Fhelps you kind of like access things
OL,18,Fthat are relevant to them, I think."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
